        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Move out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Operator",
        "text": "But we're really not familiar with the layout here. I'm worried... what if the Infected resist our operations?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Relax. I know the area. Just follow my orders."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Operator",
        "text": "Yes, Sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Operator",
        "text": "Sir, bad news: intelligence reports Reunion is moving with some degree of organization again. It seems they've found another commander."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Operator",
        "text": "And... and they've reencrypted their communication channels. We can't intercept them anymore!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Could they have joined up with the units in the slums?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Impossible. Rhodes Island should already have dealt with the situation there. There's no risk of us getting boxed in."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Strange..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Ah Ch'en, I'm ready to\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "A transmission?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "'Little Miss,' would you mind giving me the room?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "How do you work it out so you're busy every time I have something for you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Is that spy of yours back on the grid?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I said give me the room. And get me some finballs while you're out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "I'm not a kid, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
